# rust-crate rlib ports

Tree layout (like lang/python/3.x — version in path for multi-version):

  devel/rust-crates/<name>/<version>/Makefile

PKGNAME is still rust-crate-<name_underscored>-<version> (ports package identity).
Install payload paths keep crates.io name-version (vendor dirs, lib seeds):

  share/modcargo-crates/<name>-<ver>/
  lib/rust-crates/<arch>/<name>-<ver>/

Consumer (grok-build-test):
  1. BUILD_DEPENDS via files/crates.inc (PKGPATH name/version)
  2. post-extract: seed-modcargo.sh (sources)
  3. pre-build: seed-target.sh ${MODCARGO_TARGET_DIR}
  4. optional: RUSTC_WRAPPER=files/rustc-prebuilt.sh
  5. cargo build --release --offline

Daily tip with few lock changes → dpb rebuilds few rust-crate-* + consumer.
Rustc upgrade → full rebuild of rlib packages.
